abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifact for a study showing that the choice of 4-bit
  post-training quantizer is a deployment-time privacy decision. At the same
  bit-rate, the calibration-based methods AWQ and GPTQ suppress verbatim
  extraction of PII memorized during fine-tuning far more than the
  calibration-corpus-free GGUF Q4_K_M format. The artifact re-derives every
  table and figure of the paper from the committed per-seed logs and verifies
  all 141 published values.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/CristhianKapelinski/quantizer-pii-mitigation"
keywords:
